<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Manipur as rival Kuki-Zo and Naga groups engaged in gunfights, killing three Kuki-Zo volunteers and prompting large rallies demanding the SoO agreement’s abrogation and the return of displaced families. Security forces recovered the bodies of two abducted Kuki men and later arrested three militants in Imphal, while a joint operation found two missing Kuki villagers dead. In Kashmir, a convoy of the Darbar Move was escorted through Ramban under tight security and a 13-year-old boy was killed and seven people injured in a road mishap. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/india-increases-growth-forecast-for-fiscal-year/a-79798971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePrint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPamJEOXJ3S1E1X0tZa2xSX3Rra3ZENXJVUnM3SDZ5bUJIN2EtWTREanAtNV9zWGl6cHF3Sl9oV3ZTWks5NU9OWTBaQ0tNMV9JTVNVVkZyZUtJTXU3QVliVklVaGVGbGhzdTBQcnpNN2ZVbmpLY0JwRUpzYmJ6aHFpc0dLQmxFQlY1ckx2RDRPaDc2OWJGTlpmZ0gwVTN6dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNcWJnMFI4dkNiSjRCTTV3eHU2Wnk0MUx2RTBOV2p1OWt0T2dZV1kxVk5aZ2tXOVdXRnpjdWNGVDA3ZDd5eEhBREJCUWpMcWptbTktSTdkRnNUS2hUeE0zOFlZRkhkbWNZbEZBTmFsd056Zkp1QWw2UWEweUtfMG0zRGxOdmo5YmwtY3lNbnREbzkxdVFaM3RpM2htUUlKd01jNWpJSHU0NGVGLTN6bVRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;NorthEast India24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPR0txTDJUSmJqS2xvVl9GNE9RZHRTM2JuNENQN0xwNjRjX0Q2V2s2WXJ5dGozcG1OdHdjcElTYzF1QUJCTVlabWhJNldr